Gypsy jazz community hub. TanStack Start + React 19 + Vite + Tailwind 4.

Keep the wood look, globe, and nav. Do not redesign unless asked.

Facts only: real names, dates, venues, URLs. No invented jams, concerts, or luthiers.

Living players route to `/musicians/<slug>`. Django is `/django`, Grappelli is `/grappelli`.

Catalog data is TypeScript in `src/lib/` (artists, jams, concerts, festivals, venues, news). Schema is `migrations/`. Local DB is PGLite until `DATABASE_URL` is set.

Read `AGENTS.project.md` and `README.md` before large edits.
